  "description": "Aim. Fire. SMASH! Load the royal cannon, line up your shot, and watch entire towers explode into pieces. The most oddly satisfying physics puzzle you'll play all year.\n\nOne perfect shot brings the whole thing down — but can you actually clear the table?\n\nEASY TO PLAY, HARD TO PUT DOWN\nSet your angle, charge the power, fire. Simple one-tap aiming — instantly fun, endlessly addictive.\n\nREAL 3D DESTRUCTION\nSmash jars, topple stone towers, and trigger chain reactions that crumble everything in sight. Every hit is powered by realistic physics.\n\nHUNDREDS OF LEVELS\nEach level is a fresh puzzle. Find the one perfect angle, knock it all down, and last your way up through the kingdom.\n\nPURE STRESS RELIEF\nNo timers, no pressure — just you, a cannon, and a whole world to demolish.\nSatisfying to watch, impossible to stop.\n\nThink you've got the aim? Only 1% clear every table. Download Royal Smash! and start the chaos.",
  "release_notes": "Trouble Trap and Power Play is here!\nWe just gave a whole stretch of levels some extra love and the game feels noticeably smoother for it.\n\nCleaner, fairer levels. A batch of stages got reworked and retuned, so smashing feels crisp and every shot lands the way you'd expect.\n\nSame Royal Smash, now with a fresh coat of polish. Jump in and feel the difference!",
